    "description": "ACASOM ADS-B Outdoor Ultra Low Noise Amplifier - Super ADS-B-2 Boost the performance of your ADS-B receiver with the ACASOM Super ADS-B-2 Ultra Low Noise Amplifier. Specifically designed for outdoor use, this high-performance amplifier significantly enhances signal reception in challenging environments, ensuring reliable, high-quality ADS-B data. Key Features: Noise Figure: 0.8dB – Ultra-low noise figure for optimal signal clarity and minimal interference, enhancing the sensitivity and range of your ADS-B system. Receiving Gain: 23dB – Strong, consistent gain ensures better signal reception, even in remote or congested environments, maximizing the effective coverage area. The Super ADS-B-2 amplifier is ideal for improving the reception quality of ADS-B systems in aviation, air traffic control, and other critical monitoring applications. Whether used in isolated locations or dense airspace regions, this device ensures improved performance, reliability, and overall system efficiency. Applications: Aviation and air traffic control Surveillance systems Remote location signal boosting Upgrade your ADS-B system with the ACASOM Super ADS-B-2 and experience the difference in reception performance. SPECIFICATION Number Items Specifications 1 Frequency Range 1086-1094MHz 2 Operating Voltage 5-24V 3 Noise Figure ＜0.8dB 4 Current Supply 25mA 5 Receiving Gain 23dB 6 OperatingTemperature -40℃～+70℃ 7 StorageTemperature -40℃～+150℃ 8 Operating Humidity Up to 95% rel. humidity 9 RF Connector Input: N-Female; Output: N-Female 10 Power Socket 2.5*0.7mm adpter/biastee/USB 11 Shell Size 73*44*25mm 12 Shell Material Aluminum 13 Net Weight 0.12Kg INCLUDED 118SET: 1PCS* Extender 1PCS* RG402 Cable (20CM) 2PCS* RF Adapter 148SET: 1PCS* Extender 1PCS* RG402 Cable (20CM) 1PCS* Bias Tee 1PCS* USB Adapter 2PCS* RF Adapter 1PCS *EU Power Plug 208SET: 1PCS* Extender 1PCS* RG402 Cable (20CM) 1PCS* Bias Tee 1PCS* USB Adapter 2PCS* RF Adapter 1PCS *EU Power Plug 1PCS* Cavity Filter